  <value name="node_comment">Enables WxDSP

WxDSP adds a colored titlebar on the top of the screen. The titlebar color and content is controlled by the following extended settings:

  * watt.dsp.titlebar.color: CSS color for the titlebar text
  * watt.dsp.titlebar.background: CSS color for the titlebar background
  * watt.dsp.titlebar.text: Text to appear in the titlebar
  * watt.dsp.titlebar.version:  Version string to appear after the title bar text (in parenthsis)

WxDSP establishes itself as the default admin page by setting the extended setting `watt.sever.defaultPackage` to `WxDSP`. When disabling the WxDSP package the value of this setting is returned to the `Default` package.

&lt;span class="label label-warning"&gt;Tip!&lt;/span&gt; Integration Server must be restarted for the enabling/disabling to take effect.
</value>
